The passages, lines, stops, traffic alerts and the state of the metro come
from the open data portal of STAR (https://data.explore.star.fr), the bus and
metro network of Rennes Métropole run by Keolis Rennes, under the Open
Database License (ODbL 1.0): https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/.
The widgets show the source (STAR) and the time of each reading. The files
under test/fixtures are extracts of this database, kept under the same
licence.

This community integration is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by
STAR, Keolis Rennes or Rennes Métropole.
